Z||000004||West Coast Fiero||12-30-2001||04:49 PM||||you could cheat the computer ( will not actually fix the system ) by jumping wires 997 ( dark green, terminal C ) and the EGR solenoid ground ( terminal D ) in the EGR solenoid conector. This will essentially bypass the entire EGR system.<P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://clubs.hemmings.com/fieroswest/WestCoast300.gif"> <BR>Eric Nelson<BR>Technician,<BR>West Coast Fiero<BR>www.cwestco.com<BR>310-305-4111||||reg||1
