Z||000006||West Coast Fiero||12-30-2001||08:01 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by JayLT1:<BR><B>am i hurting my engine if i dont fix this????<BR>J<P></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>nope, just makes it so the EGR doesnt work. Illegal for smog and you may notice a decrease in fuel mileage<P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://clubs.hemmings.com/fieroswest/WestCoast300.gif"> <BR>Eric Nelson<BR>Technician,<BR>West Coast Fiero<BR>www.cwestco.com<BR>310-305-4111||||reg||1
